  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A closed organ pipe <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>150</mn><mo> </mo><mi>cm</mi></math> long gives <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math> beats per second with an open organ pipe of length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>350</mn><mo> </mo><mi>cm</mi></math>, both vibrating in fundamental mode. The velocity of sound is ______ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>.</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "294",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The formula to calculate the fundamental frequency in a closed pipe is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>And, that in an open pipe is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Given that</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>From equations (1), (2) and (3), it follows that</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>150</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>350</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mrow><mn>600</mn><mo> </mo><mi>cm</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mrow><mn>700</mn><mo> </mo><mi>cm</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mi>v</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>42</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>42</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>7</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mn>294</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>"
  }
